---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base title="How to use Litbuy Spreadsheet | Shopping guide" description="Follow the Litbuy buying process: find a listing, check item IDs and options, review warehouse QC, estimate shipping and contact platform support."><main class="long-guide"><p class="eyebrow" data-home-i18n="guide">How it works</p><h1 data-home-i18n="guide_page_title">How to use a Litbuy spreadsheet</h1><p class="guide-lead" data-home-i18n="guide_page_lead">Use Litbuy Sheet Lab to discover product links, review listing details, and continue to Litbuy to place an order. Prices and availability in this catalog come from a historical FindSpreadsheet export.</p><div class="guide-sections"><article><span>01</span><div><h2 data-home-i18n="guide_h2_0">Find a product in the Litbuy spreadsheet</h2><p data-home-i18n="guide_p_0">Browse a category or search by product name, brand, translated title or Weidian item number. To search by picture, select the camera beside the search box, choose an image and open the resulting product list. Image matching is approximate, so compare several results before deciding.</p><a href="/products/" data-home-i18n="guide_link_browse">Browse products ↗</a><figure class="guide-screen"><div class="guide-shot"><img src="/guide-catalog.png" alt="Litbuy Sheet Lab product list and search bar" loading="lazy"/><svg class="guide-annotation" viewBox="0 0 100 100" preserveAspectRatio="none" aria-hidden="true"><defs><marker id="guide-tip-1" markerWidth="5" markerHeight="5" refX="4" refY="2.5" orient="auto"><path d="M0 0 L5 2.5 L0 5 Z" fill="#ff6500"/></marker></defs><path d="M22 27 L32 43" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="1.6"/><path d="M22 27 L32 43" stroke="#ff6500" stroke-width=".8" marker-end="url(#guide-tip-1)"/></svg><span class="guide-arrow-label" style="--label-x:12%;--label-y:20%">Search the catalog</span></div><figcaption data-home-i18n="guide_figcaption_0">Actual Litbuy Sheet Lab product list: search, categories and product cards.</figcaption></figure></div></article><article><span>02</span><div><h2 data-home-i18n="guide_h2_1">Review the product details and seller photos</h2><p data-home-i18n="guide_p_1">Open a product card to see its price estimate, product number and available images. Check the current listing for the exact colour, size, options and stock. An image in a seller gallery is a product photo; it is not necessarily a warehouse quality-control photo.</p><figure class="guide-screen"><div class="guide-shot"><img src="/guide-product.png" alt="Litbuy Sheet Lab product page showing the purchase and Weidian link controls" loading="lazy"/><svg class="guide-annotation" viewBox="0 0 100 100" preserveAspectRatio="none" aria-hidden="true"><defs><marker id="guide-tip-2" markerWidth="5" markerHeight="5" refX="4" refY="2.5" orient="auto"><path d="M0 0 L5 2.5 L0 5 Z" fill="#ff6500"/></marker></defs><path d="M39 21 L37 42" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="1.6"/><path d="M39 21 L37 42" stroke="#ff6500" stroke-width=".8" marker-end="url(#guide-tip-2)"/></svg><span class="guide-arrow-label" style="--label-x:29%;--label-y:14%">Review the listing</span></div><figcaption data-home-i18n="guide_figcaption_1">Actual product detail page: image carousel, item ID and purchase controls. The displayed price is a historical estimate.</figcaption></figure></div></article><article><span>03</span><div><h2 data-home-i18n="guide_h2_2">Open the Litbuy product link</h2><p data-home-i18n="guide_p_2">Select the Litbuy buying button on the product detail page. You can also copy the Weidian link or choose another available buying agent. Register or sign in on Litbuy, then verify that the product and item number match before choosing any options.</p><a href="https://litbuy.com/register?inviteCode=E32JME4UQ" target="_blank" rel="noopener" data-home-i18n="guide_link_register">Register or sign in ↗</a><figure class="guide-screen"><div class="guide-shot"><img src="/guide-product.png" alt="Product detail page showing the Litbuy purchase button" loading="lazy"/><svg class="guide-annotation" viewBox="0 0 100 100" preserveAspectRatio="none" aria-hidden="true"><defs><marker id="guide-tip-3" markerWidth="5" markerHeight="5" refX="4" refY="2.5" orient="auto"><path d="M0 0 L5 2.5 L0 5 Z" fill="#ff6500"/></marker></defs><path d="M61 39 L61 46" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="1.6"/><path d="M61 39 L61 46" stroke="#ff6500" stroke-width=".8" marker-end="url(#guide-tip-3)"/></svg><span class="guide-arrow-label" style="--label-x:51%;--label-y:32%">Continue to Litbuy</span></div><figcaption data-home-i18n="guide_figcaption_2">Actual product page: choose the Litbuy button to continue to the platform.</figcaption></figure></div></article><article><span>04</span><div><h2 data-home-i18n="guide_h2_3">Choose options and review the order</h2><p data-home-i18n="guide_p_3">On Litbuy, check the seller's size chart, colour, quantity and available notes. Review the item price, domestic delivery and any service charges shown at checkout. Fees, inventory and payment methods can change; use Litbuy's current order screen as the source of truth.</p><figure class="guide-screen"><div class="guide-shot"><img src="/guide-litbuy.png" alt="Litbuy product page showing colour, size, quantity and order controls" loading="lazy"/><svg class="guide-annotation" viewBox="0 0 100 100" preserveAspectRatio="none" aria-hidden="true"><defs><marker id="guide-tip-4" markerWidth="5" markerHeight="5" refX="4" refY="2.5" orient="auto"><path d="M0 0 L5 2.5 L0 5 Z" fill="#ff6500"/></marker></defs><path d="M66 21 L58 45" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="1.6"/><path d="M66 21 L58 45" stroke="#ff6500" stroke-width=".8" marker-end="url(#guide-tip-4)"/></svg><span class="guide-arrow-label" style="--label-x:56%;--label-y:14%">Choose colour and size</span></div><figcaption data-home-i18n="guide_figcaption_3">Actual Litbuy product page: check colour, size, quantity and price before adding an item to your cart. Values shown are an example and may change.</figcaption></figure></div></article><article><span>05</span><div><h2 data-home-i18n="guide_h2_4">Review warehouse QC photos</h2><p data-home-i18n="guide_p_4">After an item reaches the warehouse, check the inspection photos available in your Litbuy account. Compare labels, colour, visible damage, stitching and measurements where shown. If you see a problem, contact Litbuy before arranging international shipping. This catalog cannot currently load its QC feed directly. Litbuy’s SourceTrack tool can show warehouse receipt and QC image generation status for an eligible tracking number; view actual QC photos in your account.</p><figure class="guide-screen"><div class="guide-shot"><img src="/guide-source-track.png" alt="Litbuy SourceTrack page with warehouse and QC generation status fields" loading="lazy"/><svg class="guide-annotation" viewBox="0 0 100 100" preserveAspectRatio="none" aria-hidden="true"><defs><marker id="guide-tip-5" markerWidth="5" markerHeight="5" refX="4" refY="2.5" orient="auto"><path d="M0 0 L5 2.5 L0 5 Z" fill="#ff6500"/></marker></defs><path d="M40 22 L46 32" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="1.6"/><path d="M40 22 L46 32" stroke="#ff6500" stroke-width=".8" marker-end="url(#guide-tip-5)"/></svg><span class="guide-arrow-label" style="--label-x:30%;--label-y:15%">Enter tracking number</span></div><figcaption data-home-i18n="guide_figcaption_4">Actual Litbuy SourceTrack screen. This is a status lookup, not a QC photo gallery; no tracking number was entered.</figcaption></figure></div></article><article><span>06</span><div><h2 data-home-i18n="guide_h2_5">Plan international shipping</h2><p data-home-i18n="guide_p_5">Check the packed weight and dimensions, destination, available routes, insurance and prohibited-item rules in Litbuy. If you combine items, compare the final parcel cost and restrictions before submitting. Taxes and customs requirements depend on the destination.</p><figure class="guide-screen"><div class="guide-shot"><img src="/guide-shipping.png" alt="Litbuy freight estimator with destination and weight fields" loading="lazy"/><svg class="guide-annotation" viewBox="0 0 100 100" preserveAspectRatio="none" aria-hidden="true"><defs><marker id="guide-tip-6" markerWidth="5" markerHeight="5" refX="4" refY="2.5" orient="auto"><path d="M0 0 L5 2.5 L0 5 Z" fill="#ff6500"/></marker></defs><path d="M20 9 L39 47" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="1.6"/><path d="M20 9 L39 47" stroke="#ff6500" stroke-width=".8" marker-end="url(#guide-tip-6)"/></svg><span class="guide-arrow-label" style="--label-x:10%;--label-y:2%">Set destination and weight</span></div><figcaption data-home-i18n="guide_figcaption_5">Actual Litbuy freight estimator: enter destination and parcel details to check available estimates.</figcaption></figure></div></article><article><span>07</span><div><h2 data-home-i18n="guide_h2_6">Track your parcel and request support</h2><p data-home-i18n="guide_p_6">Keep your order and tracking details, follow the parcel status in Litbuy and contact its support team about missing, damaged or incorrect items. Review the current return, exchange and storage rules before taking action.</p><a href="https://litbuy.com/help" target="_blank" rel="noopener" data-home-i18n="guide_link_help">Litbuy help center ↗</a><figure class="guide-screen"><div class="guide-shot"><img src="/guide-help.png" alt="Litbuy help center showing shipment tracking and after-sales entries" loading="lazy"/><svg class="guide-annotation" viewBox="0 0 100 100" preserveAspectRatio="none" aria-hidden="true"><defs><marker id="guide-tip-7" markerWidth="5" markerHeight="5" refX="4" refY="2.5" orient="auto"><path d="M0 0 L5 2.5 L0 5 Z" fill="#ff6500"/></marker></defs><path d="M16 31 L29 36" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="1.6"/><path d="M16 31 L29 36" stroke="#ff6500" stroke-width=".8" marker-end="url(#guide-tip-7)"/></svg><span class="guide-arrow-label" style="--label-x:6%;--label-y:24%">Track or request help</span></div><figcaption data-home-i18n="guide_figcaption_6">Actual Litbuy help center: shipment tracking and after-sales support entries.</figcaption></figure></div></article></div><section class="guide-status"><h2 data-home-i18n="guide_status_title">Follow the order from purchase to delivery</h2><p data-home-i18n="guide_status_body">Litbuy’s official beginner guide describes the sequence as order submitted, order placed, seller shipped, warehouse arrival, inspection and storage, shipping requested, parcel packed, shipped and delivered. Use your account to check the current status and contact support when you need help. Timing depends on the seller, warehouse and route.</p><a href="https://litbuy.com/beginner-guide" target="_blank" rel="noopener" data-home-i18n="guide_link_official">Open the official Litbuy user guide ↗</a></section><p class="data-note">Screenshots illustrate the controls. Current prices, options and page layouts may differ.</p><p class="data-note" data-home-i18n="guide_disclaimer">Litbuy Sheet Lab is an independent product-discovery site. The platform controls ordering, inspection, shipping and support.</p></main></Base>
